# Keep the Docker build context small and the image clean.
#
# NOTE: `*.md` only matches the build-context root (Docker patterns do not cross
# `/`), so it drops README.md but KEEPS inst/extdata/help/main.md, which the app
# loads at runtime. Do NOT change this to `**/*.md` — that would break in-app help.

# Version control
.git
.gitignore

# OS / editor / tooling cruft
**/.DS_Store
.vscode
.claude
.Rhistory
.RData
.Rproj.user
*.Rproj

# CI / deployment files (not needed inside the image)
.github
Dockerfile
docker-compose.yml
.dockerignore
application.yml
.markdownlint.json
_pkgdown.yml

# Root-level docs
*.md

# Build/dev outputs and non-runtime package dirs
webr
site
docs
doc
Meta
specs
tests
vignettes
